{"anomaly_threshold":50,"author":["Elastic"],"description":"机器学习：检测Linux异常编译器活动。对应需求：Linux主机异常。官方：Anomalous Linux Compiler Activity。","false_positives":["合法变更窗口内的运维、发布或新业务上线","基线学习期的机器学习误报"],"from":"now-45m","interval":"15m","license":"Elastic License v2","machine_learning_job_id":["v3_linux_rare_user_compiler_ea"],"name":"【默认】Linux异常编译器活动（机器学习）","setup":"## 设置说明\n\n1. 目标 Linux 主机安装 Elastic Agent，启用 **Elastic Defend** 与/或 **auditd**。\n2. 关联的机器学习 job 成功启动后再评估告警。\n3. 确认相关数据流有数据后再启用。\n","risk_score":21,"rule_id":"cd66a419-9b3f-4f57-8ff8-ac4cd2d5f530","severity":"low","tags":["操作系统: Linux","主题: 主机安全","来源: 默认","规则类型: 机器学习","对应需求: Linux主机异常"],"type":"machine_learning","note":"## 调查指引\n\n### 规则说明\nLinux异常编译器活动\n\n### 为何重要\n相对 Linux 主机基线出现罕见进程、网络或侦察行为\n\n### 调查步骤\n1. 核对告警实体、时间窗与是否处于 ML 基线学习期。\n2. 核对关联主机、用户、进程或网络目的是否符合变更窗口。\n3. 关联同实体前后同类告警与落地文件/外连。\n\n### 常见误报\n- 合法变更窗口内的运维、发布或新业务上线\n- 机器学习基线尚未稳定\n\n### 响应建议\n1. 确认是否授权与变更窗口。\n2. 无授权则隔离主机或账号，并排查持久化与外连。\n3. 按主机与用户关联前后同类告警。\n","threat":[{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1588","name":"Obtain Capabilities","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1588/","subtechnique":[{"id":"T1588.001","name":"Malware","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1588/001/"}]}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0042","name":"Resource Development","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0042/"}},{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1127","name":"Trusted Developer Utilities Proxy Execution","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1127/"}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0005","name":"Defense Evasion","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0005/"}},{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1068","name":"Exploitation for Privilege Escalation","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1068/"}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0004","name":"Privilege Escalation","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0004/"}}],"related_integrations":[{"package":"auditd_manager","version":"*"},{"package":"endpoint","versio